fluid-soundfont (3.1-5) unstable; urgency=low

  * Revert flac compression. Closes: #560775, #566216
    + Use just bzip2 now; lzma (were it available) is hardly more efficient.
    + Binary size increase of approximately 56%.
  * fluid-soundfont-gm now only suggests -gs. Closes: #571316
    + fluid-soundfont-gs now only Recommends -gm.
  * Update Standards-Version to 3.8.4.

